EXPERIMENT 3: BUS TICKET BOOKING SYSTEM
1. AIM
To design and develop an Online Bus Ticket Booking System using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to display available buses, select seats, enter passenger details, calculate ticket fares, and confirm bookings.
2. ALGORITHM
1. Start the program.
2. Create a webpage displaying bus details and booking options.
3. Design the webpage using HTML and CSS.
4. Display available buses with their routes, departure times, and ticket prices.
5. Allow users to select a bus and enter their journey details.
6. Display available seats and allow users to select seats.
7. Accept passenger details and validate the entered information.
8. Calculate the total ticket fare based on the number of selected seats.
9. Confirm the booking and generate a booking ID.
10. Display the booking confirmation with passenger, bus, seat, and fare details.
